    "text": "I labelled all 8 columns of `lab_results_20261019.csv` and submitted them to report_profile for job 1.\n\n- **result_id**: identifier, PHI (it links to a lab result for a person)\n- **patient_ref**: identifier, PHI\n- **collected_date**: date, PHI (a date tied to an individual's care)\n- **loinc_code**: code, not PHI\n- **result_value**: amount, not PHI\n- **unit**: code, not PHI\n- **abnormal_flag**: code, not PHI\n- **ordering_provider**: name, PHI\n\n`profile_file` returned an error because the feed has no contract yet, so the labels rest on `diff_schema`'s shapes and inferred types. I marked `result_id` and `collected_date` as PHI on the conservative side; the contract writer may want to confirm them.\n\nLabelled 8 columns.",
